# Trivy vulnerability ignore list for implementer-interface
#
# This project uses Node 12.x with legacy dependencies that cannot be easily
# upgraded. Vulnerabilities are grouped by rationale below.
#
# --- Build/dev-time only (not bundled into production artifact) ---
# These exist only in the webpack/karma/babel/eslint toolchain.

# babel-traverse (transitive from babel-core, build-time transpiler)
CVE-2023-45133

# form-data (transitive from webpack-dev-server / fetch-mock)
CVE-2025-7783
CVE-2026-12143

# hawk / hoek (transitive from old npm auth libraries, dev tooling)
CVE-2022-29167
CVE-2020-36604

# immutable (transitive from bahmni-form-controls-cure; vulnerable code is bundled
# inside the dist/bundle.js of that package — a yarn resolution cannot fix the
# embedded copy; real fix requires a new bahmni-form-controls-cure release)
CVE-2026-29063
CVE-2026-59879
CVE-2026-59880

# ini (transitive from node/npm build tooling)
CVE-2020-7788

# json5 (transitive from babel / webpack config parsing)
CVE-2022-46175

# loader-utils (webpack internal utility)
CVE-2022-37601
CVE-2022-37599
CVE-2022-37603

# brace-expansion (transitive from minimatch / dev toolchain only — karma, webpack, eslint;
# CVE-2026-14257 fixed only in 5.0.8 which is semver-incompatible with minimatch's ^1.1.7)
CVE-2026-14257

# image-size (transitive optional dep of `less` CSS preprocessor — build-time only;
# DoS via crafted image buffer has no attack surface in a CLI build step;
# no fixed version available as of 2026-08-18)
CVE-2025-71329
CVE-2025-71330

# minimatch (transitive from karma, mocha, eslint)
CVE-2022-3517
CVE-2026-26996
CVE-2026-27903
CVE-2026-27904

# minimist (transitive from dev CLI tools)
CVE-2021-44906

# path-to-regexp (transitive from webpack-dev-server)
CVE-2024-45296

# qs (transitive from express / webpack-dev-server middleware)
CVE-2022-24999

# semver (transitive from npm/yarn/node dev tooling)
CVE-2022-25883

# shelljs (transitive from some build tool)
CVE-2022-0144

# static-eval (transitive from a webpack plugin)
GHSA-x9hc-rw35-f44h

# underscore (transitive from karma / mocha test runners)
CVE-2021-23358
CVE-2026-27601

# --- Production bundle deps (attack vectors do not apply to a client-side admin SPA) ---

# jsonpath: arbitrary code execution requires untrusted jsonpath expressions;
# in this app expressions are authored by admins in the form builder.
CVE-2026-1615

# lodash: prototype pollution / arbitrary execution via untrusted template input;
# this app does not accept external lodash templates.
CVE-2026-4800

# moment: path traversal affects server-side locale loading; not applicable to
# a browser bundle.
CVE-2022-24785
CVE-2022-31129
